swap.t.sol
├── when call is reentrant
│  └── it should revert
└── when call is not reentrant
   ├── given the module is suspended
   │  └── it should revert with Suspended
   └── given the module is not suspended
      ├── given the module is paused
      │  └── it should revert with Paused
      └── given the module is not paused
         ├── when caller is not a registered operator
         │  └── it should revert with UnauthorizedCaller
         └── when caller is a registered operator
            ├── when the input token is not a contract
            │  └── it should revert with InvalidInputToken
            └── when the input token is a contract
               ├── given the input token transfer from the module's safe fails
               │  └── it should revert
               ├── given the input token transfer from the module's safe returns false
               │  └── it should revert with TransferFromSafeFailed
               └── given the input token transfer from the module's safe succeeds
                  ├── given the swapper targets are not set
                  │  └── it should revert with SwapperTargetsNotSet
                  └── given the swapper targets are set
                     ├── given the swap order fails to be executed
                     │  └── it should revert with SwapFailed
                     └── given the swap order is successfully executed
                        ├── given the output amount is smaller than the given minimum
                        │  └── it should revert with AmountOutTooLow
                        └── given the output amount is not smaller than the given minimum
                           ├── given operating mode is Open
                           │  ├── it should spend order.inputAmount of order.inputToken from the module's safe
                           │  ├── it should transfer the swap fee, if any, to the fee collector
                           │  ├── it should transfer at least order.minOutputAmount of order.outputToken, minus the fee, to the module's safe
                           │  └── it should emit a Swap event
                           └── given operating mode is Fenced or Walled
                              ├── given there is an ongoing cooldown for swaps
                              │  └── it should revert with OngoingCooldown
                              └── given there is no ongoing cooldown for swaps
                                 ├── given price data is not registered for the input or output token
                                 │  └── it should revert with PriceFeedRouteNotRegistered
                                 └── given price data is registered for both the input and output tokens
                                    ├── given the value loss induced by the swap is higher than maxSwapLossBps
                                    │  └── it should revert with MaxValueLossExceeded
                                    └── given the value loss induced by the swap is not higher than maxSwapLossBps
                                       ├── it should spend order.inputAmount of order.inputToken from the module's safe
                                       ├── it should transfer the swap fee, if any, to the fee collector
                                       ├── it should transfer at least order.minOutputAmount of order.outputToken, minus the fee, to the module's safe
                                       └── it should emit a Swap event
